  "description": "The Copperhead EVO AM 1 750 is built for riders who crave adventure on technical trails and tough terrain. With its full-suspension setup, powerful Bosch motor, and trail-ready components, this eMTB is ready to shred from the first ride.\n\nMotor and Battery\n\nMotor: Bosch Gen4 Performance Line CX motor with 85 Nm of torque. Delivers smooth power, intuitive handling, and punchy acceleration for trail and cross-country riding.\n\nBattery: Bosch PowerTube 750 Wh, fully integrated into the frame for a sleek look. Offers long range and takes around 6 hours for a full charge.\n\nSuspension and Frame\n\nFork: SR Suntour Lytro 35 Supreme SL Boost with 150mm of travel to handle rough, technical trails.\n\nRear Shock: SR Suntour Edge Plus TR 2CR with 150mm of rear travel for maximum traction and control.\n\nFrame: Lightweight aluminum 6061 frame with internal cable routing. Available in multiple frame sizes for the perfect fit.\n\nDrivetrain and Brakes\n\nGears: Shimano Deore 10-speed drivetrain offers a wide gear range for climbing and descending with ease.\n\nBrakes: Tektro HD-M390 hydraulic disc brakes with 203mm rotor up front and 180mm in the rear for powerful and controlled braking.\n\nWheels and Tires\n\nWheels: 27.5\" wheels offer agile handling and reliable traction on twisty trails.\n\nTires: VeeTire Crown Gem 2.6\" wide tires provide grip and confidence on all surfaces.\n\nAdditional Features\n\nRemote: Bosch LED Remote with Bluetooth connectivity. Displays ride info and syncs with your phone for deeper ride data. Bright, simple, and thumb-friendly.\n\nDropper Post: Limotec A1-Z dropper post for on-the-fly saddle height adjustments—perfect for trail transitions.\n\nPedals and Saddle: Comes with BULLS MTB pedals and a BULLS Sportive Ergo saddle for a secure and comfortable ride.\n\nTechnology and Design\n\nMonkeyLink Ready: Integrated mounts for quick, clean installation of lights and fenders.\n\nClass-1 eBike: Pedal-assist support up to 20 mph, ideal for trail and park compliance.\n\nThe Copperhead EVO AM 1 750 is the ultimate trail partner for riders who want big performance, bold features, and the freedom to ride harder, longer, and smarter.",
